g_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Warding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Aura_of_Warding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Warding_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Warding (Condition)\">Aura of Warding</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to damage from spells within 3 m (10 ft) of the spellcaster.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Aura_of_Warding\">Sources of Aura of Warding</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Warding\" title=\"Aura of Warding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/im